# Adversarial review of the dependent-type branch, finding 2: n = 1000 and 4000.
# get!, getD, modify, set! on an Array Float; get! and modify on one-field
# structures over Float and UInt64; constants pushed. Native allocates no
# cell per read (the default is boxed once) and one per update (the new
# value); lean2rr must grow as native does. Before the fix a get! made a
# Float cell per read (4n), and a modify or set! two cells per update.
get 1000 | get 4000 | 1 200
getd 1000 | getd 4000 | 1 200
modify 1000 | modify 4000 | 1 200
set 1000 | set 4000 | 1 200
getw 1000 | getw 4000 | 1 200
getu 1000 | getu 4000 | 1 200
modw 1000 | modw 4000 | 1 200
pushc 1000 | pushc 4000 | 1 200
pushu 1000 | pushu 4000 | 1 200
pushl 1000 | pushl 4000 | 1 200
